{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西班牙警方緝獲接近3公噸可卡因，8名犯毒集團成員被捕。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SPA.COCAINE-0200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026H4MN5buobi1791754341.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>西班牙國民警衛隊星期日於中部瓜達拉哈拉市一個住宅緝獲這批可卡因，並且在多架汽車旁發現4支步槍及8個彈匣，其中一架車的暗格藏有2.8萬歐元現金。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SPA.COCAINE-0200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ABYR1BS90x1791754335.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>毒犯在屋內包裝毒品，之後將毒品收藏在汽車暗格，於西班牙及歐洲其他地方分銷。被捕的8人中有7人已收監。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SPA.COCAINE-0200_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026GXpmhJwbqu1791754314.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T22:17:59.724060+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}